@startuml
title CopilotKit GitHub Copilot SDK — High-Level Architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User

package "Application" {
  [Web UI] as UI
  [CopilotKit API Route\n/api/copilotkit/*] as API
}

package "Agent" {
  [Copilot SDK Agent] as AG
}

Package "GitHub Copilot" {
  [Copilot SDK / Runtime] as SDK
  [Model and Tool Services] as Services
}

User --> UI : Interacts
UI --> API : Agent requests
API --> AG : Dispatches request
AG --> SDK : Runs agent
SDK --> Services : Model / tool calls

Services --> SDK : Results
SDK --> Agent : Agent events
AG --> API : Responses / stream
API --> UI : Streamed updates
UI --> User : Displays response

note bottom of API
  Conceptual view; verify component boundaries
  and external service details against the code.
end note
@enduml